| 2nd | Study/nursery | [2,9,17,9,11,23] | spruce_planks |
| 2nd | Back bedroom | [2,9,25,8,11,31] | spruce_planks |
| 2nd | Bathroom | [10,9,25,13,11,31] | spruce_planks |
